    Candidate Language=GD-GB: An cunntas agad
  \personalDataExport\PrivacyTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft
  \personalDataExport\PrivacyStatementUrl:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=850749
  \personalDataExport\PrivacyLinkDisplayText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: https://aka.ms/privacy
  \personalDataExport\Paragraph3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Nì Microsoft pròiseasadh is tar-chur an dàta agad a-rèir aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft.
  \personalDataExport\Paragraph2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mur an aontaich thu ri tar-chur dàta mar seo, is urrainn dhut sgur dhen a bhith a’ cleachdadh a’ bhathair. Thoir sùil air teirmichean a’ chleachdaidh aig a’ bhathar agad a thaobh ath-dhìolaidh.
  \personalDataExport\Paragraph1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mus obraich am bathar seo mar bu chòir, feumaidh Microsoft an dàta agad a ghluasad gu ionad-dàta Microsoft a tha taobh a-muigh do dhùthcha no roinn-dùthcha. Ma chleachdas tu am bathar seo fhathast, bidh tu ag aontachadh ris an tar-chur dàta seo.
  \personalDataExport\PageTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thèid an dàta agad a phròiseasadh taobh a-muigh do dhùthcha no roinn-dùthcha
  \personalDataExport\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \personalDataExport\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadas leis a’ cheangal againn – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil rudeigin ceàrr a-bhos an-seo.<ul><li>Airson fiosrachadh carson a dh’fheumas sinn an dàta agad a chur gun t-Sìn o dhùthaich eile nuair a chleachdas tu am bathar seo, sgrìobh https://aka.ms/productslist ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh aig brabhsair sam bith.</li><br/><li>Airson barrachd fiosrachaidh mun phrìobhaideachd is bathar Microsoft, faic aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft aig https://aka.ms/privacy.</li></ul>
  \personalDataExport\LearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu roghainnean an dàta agad
  \personalDataExport\LearnMoreDataTransferUrl:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2214603
  \personalDataExport\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \personalDataExport\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeZdp\ScanningVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Checking for updates.
  \oobeZdp\Scanning:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A’ toirt sùil airson ùrachaidhean
  \oobeZdp\FinishedReboot:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Nì am PC agad ath-thòiseachadh mus lean thu air adhart
  \oobeZdp\FinishedFinal:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha mhòr nach eil e deiseil! Chan eil sinn ach a’ coileanadh a’ cheum seo
  \oobeZdp\Finished1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha brod bathair air an t-slighe thugad
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstallingLoop4:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mòran taing airson a bhith cho foighidinneach
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstallingLoop3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha sinn ag ullachadh rudan dhut
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstallingLoop2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh fois fhad ’s a nì sinne beagan draoidheachd
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstallingLoop1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cùm am PC agad air
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstalling1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Just a moment, checking for updates. Your PC might restart a few times along the way. Please, don't turn it off until we're all done.
  \oobeZdp\DownloadingAndInstalling1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mionaid bheag, a’ toirt sùil airson ùrachaidhean
  \oobeWelcome\LaunchNarratorInstruction:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gus an t-uidheam agad a shuidheachadh le leughadair-sgrìn, cuir an neach-aithris air le bhith a’ brùthadh Windows + Control + Enter. Airson barrachd roghainnean na so-ruigsinneachd, brùth air Windows + U no tagh ìomhaigheag na so-ruigsinneachd san oisean aig a’ bhonn.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro5VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Use your voice or the keyboard along the way, and if you’d like me to stay quiet, just select the little microphone icon towards the bottom of your screen.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A little sign-in here, a touch of Wi-Fi there, and we’ll have your PC ready for all you plan to do.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Hi there! I’m Cortana, and I’m here to help.
  \oobeWelcome\CortanaAnimationAccString:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Seo Cortana a’ bruidhinn
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Fan tèarainte le ùrachaidhean
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cumaidh ùrachaidhean cunbhalach a' ruith an uidheim agad gu tèarainte rèidh agus cuiridh iad gleusan ùra ri do làimh airson dèanadas nas motha air feadh nan uidheaman agad. Tagh roghainnean ùrachaidh dhut is an uairsin tagh "Gabh ris" gus an sàbhaladh. 'S urrainn dhut na roghainnean agad atharrachadh uair sam bith.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sleamhnachan %1 aig %2.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh ris
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu na roghainnean seo
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mar a dh’atharraicheas tu na roghainnean ùrachaidh airson aplacaidean a’ Microsoft Store
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mar a dh’atharraicheas tu na roghainnean ùrachaidh airson Windows Update
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ùrachaidhean fèin-obrachail airson aplacaidean Windows agus Microsoft Store
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh "Barrachd fiosrachaidh" airson fiosrachadh mu na roghainnean gu h-àrd.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S urrainn dhut na roghainnean ùrachaidh agad atharrachadh uair sam bith ’s tu a’ tadhal air “Microsoft Store” » “Faic barrachd” » “Roghainnean”.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S urrainn dhut na roghainnean ùrachaidh agad atharrachadh uair sam bith ’s tu a’ tadhal air “Roghainnean” » “Ùrachadh ⁊ tèarainteachd” » “Windows Update” » “Roghainnean adhartach”.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cumaidh ùrachadh cunbhalach an t-uidheam agad tèarainte dìon agus a’ ruith gu rèidh. Ma thaghas tu na h-ùrachaidhean fèin-obrachail, thèid an luchdadh a-nuas dhan uidheam agad cho luath ’s a bhios iad ri làimh ach am bi na càraidhean tèarainteachd agus leasachaidhean as ùire agad, mar dhìonadair Microsoft, draibhearan agus ùrachaidhean bathair-an-sàs. Ma chuireas tu romhad gun a bhith a’ faighinn nan ùrachaidhean fèin-obrachail, bheir Microsoft sùil fhathast a bheil ùrachaidhean ri am faighinn dhan uidheam agad. Innsidh sinn dhut o àm gu àm ma bhios ùrachadh ri fhaighinn. ’S urrainn dhut co-dhùnadh an tèid na h-ùrachaidhean a luchdadh a-nuas gus nach tèid ach cha bhi làn-dìon agad agus cha bhi gach rud cho ùraichte ’s a ghabhas mur an luchdaich a-nuas is mur an stàlaich thu iad.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh an t-uidheam agad a' ruith socair rèidh an cois ùrachaidhean cunbhalach. Cuir romhad a bheil thu ag iarraidh ùrachaidhean aplacaidean. Windows is Microsoft Store gu fèin-obrachail agus tagh "Gabh ris" an uairsin.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettings\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na roghainnean prìobhaideachd airson an uidheim agad
  \oobeSettings\SettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha Microsoft a’ toirt smachd dhut air do phrìobhaideachd. Tagh roghainnean dhut is an uairsin tagh <b>Gabh ris</b> gus an sàbhaladh. Faodaidh tu roghainnean seo atharrachadh uair sam bith.
  \oobeSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sleamhnachan %1 aig %2.
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A-nis, gluais tro thabaichean nan roghainnean prìobhaideachd uile airson leantainn air adhart
  \oobeSettings\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadasan againn leis a chomas-cheangail – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil duilgheadas againn a-bhos an-seo. ’S urrainn dhut aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft a leughadh gu slàn uair sam bith ’s tu a’ sgrìobhadh aka.ms/privacy ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh aig brabhsair sam bith air uidheam sam bith.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu na roghainnean seo
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh <b>Barrachd fiosrachaidh</b> airson fiosrachadh mu na roghainnean gu h-àrd, mar a dhìonas Windows thu o aplacaidean is susbaint-lìn nach eil sàbhailte agus na tar-chuir is cleachdadh an dàta a tha co-cheangailte ris.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Seo na roghainnean a mholadh Microsoft. Siuthad, thoir sùil orra is tagh "Gabh ris" nuair a bhios tu deiseil.
  \oobeSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh ris
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh ri gach roghainn prìobhaideachd
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na roghainnean prìobhaideachd airson an uidheim agad
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh ris
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadasan againn leis a chomas-cheangail – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil duilgheadas againn a-bhos an-seo. ’S urrainn dhut aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft a leughadh gu slàn uair sam bith ’s tu a’ sgrìobhadh aka.ms/privacy ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh aig brabhsair sam bith air uidheam sam bith.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\MultiSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh roghainnean dhut is an uairsin tagh <b>Gabh ris</b> gus an sàbhaladh. Lean an ceangal ri <b>Barrachd fiosrachaidh</b> airson fiosrachadh mu na roghainnean, mar a dh’atharraicheas tu iad, mar a dhìonas Windows thu o aplacaidean is susbaint-lìn nach eil sàbhailte agus na tar-chuir is cleachdadh an dàta a tha co-cheangailte ris.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LocationVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Now, choose if you want to let Microsoft and other apps use your location to help you with directions, weather, and more.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu na roghainnean seo
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\InputDiagnosticsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: And if you want to help improve language recognition and suggestions for apps and services that run on Windows, you can choose to do that here.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\FindMyDeviceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: And if you ever lose your device, here's where you get to choose if you want help finding it.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\AdsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Last up for these settings, choose whether or not you want your ads to be more relevant to you.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Title:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruinneachadh de dhàta riatanach
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha do phrìobhaideachd cudromach agus ri linn sinn, bu toil leinn mìneachadh dhut dè an dàta a chruinnicheas sinn.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha Microsoft a’ dèanamh a dhìcheall airson brod an dìon o chunnartan digiteach a thoirt dhut. Ri linn sin, bidh Microsoft Defender SmartScreen agus uidheam-smachd tapaidh nan aplacaidean a’ cruinneachadh fiosrachadh mun na làraichean-lìn air an tadhail thu, faidhlichean a luchdaicheas tu a-nuas agus aplacaidean a stàlaicheas is a ruitheas tu. Cleachdaidh sinn an dàta seo gus thu fhèin, an t-uidheam agad agus na faclan-faire agad a dhìon o aplacaidean is susbaint-lìn nach eil sàbhailte agus airson rabhaidhean a thoirt dhut.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruinnichidh Microsoft fiosrachadh mun uidheam agad, na roghainnean is comasan aige agus a bheil e ag obair mar bu chòir. ’S e na th’ ann an dàta diagnosachd riatanach an ìre as lugha de dhàta diagnosachd a dh’fheumas sinn airson an t-uidheam agad a chumail earbsach, tèarainte agus ag obair mar bu chòir agus airson obair-leasachaidh a dhèanamh air Windows.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dìon o aplacaidean is susbaint-lìn neo-shàbhailte
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dàta diagnosachd riatanach
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruinneachadh de dhàta riatanach
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcBodyText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruinnichidh Microsoft dàta riatanach airson an t-uidheam agad a chumail ùraichte, tèarainte agus ag obair mar bu chòir. Dh’fhaoidte gun gabh seo a-staigh fiosrachadh mu na faidhlichean is roghainnean nan aplacaidean agad agus fiosrachadh a chuidicheas sinn a’ càradh duilgheadasan.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadas leis a’ cheangal againn – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil rudeigin ceàrr a-bhos an-seo. Gheibh thu barrachd fiosrachaidh air na th’ ann an dàta diagnosachd riatanach le bhith a’ cur https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162067 ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh ann am brabhsair sam bith air uidheam sam bith.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu chruinneachadh an dàta riatanaich
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeSettingsAadc\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha thu an impis an Retail Demo Experience a chur à comas
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmSecondayCommandText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sguir dheth
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dearbh
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmContent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Suathaidh seo bàn an t-susbaint air fad.  Ma chuireas tu an Retail Demo Experience an comas a-rithist, cha bhi susbaint aige gus an ceangail thu ris an eadar-lìon.
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha thu an impis an Retail Demo Experience a chur air
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmSecondayCommandText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sguir dheth
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dearbh
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chuir thu air an Retail Demo Experience
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedContent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Lean air adhart tron t-suidheachadh. Cuidichidh sinn thu a’ faighinn na susbaint is nan aplacaidean demo as ùire.
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmContent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan ann ach airson bùithtean a tha seo. Mur eil thu airson am PC seo a shuidheachadh mar demo ann am bùth, sguir dheth is till dhan t-suidheachadh àbhaisteach.
  \oobeRegion\YesButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha
  \oobeRegion\StringWithRegionVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Your country or region is set to %1. Is that right?
  \oobeRegion\RegionToUseVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Which country or region do you want to use?
  \oobeRegion\RegionTitle:
