  \oobeLocalAccount\UseOnlineAccountButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air neo nas fheàrr buileach, cleachd cunntas air loidhne
  \oobeLocalAccount\UseMSAAccountText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gus clàradh a-steach leis an uidheam seo an àite sin, tagh “Cleachd cunntas air loidhne”
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha an raon seo riatanach.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSATitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir ceistean tèarainteachd ris a-nis
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSALeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air eagal ’s gun dìochuimhnich thu am facal-faire agad uaireigin, tagh trì ceistean tèarainteachd. Dèan cinnteach gun tagh thu rudan nach dìochuimhnich thu.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSAErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: You’ll need to finish entering your security questions before you can continue.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Third one's a charm. Choose your last question, type the answer, and you're good to go.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Now for the second one. Same drill.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Now you can set up 3 security questions to help you reset your password if you forget it. Choose the first question and type your answer.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceist tèarainteachd (3 à 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceist tèarainteachd (2 à 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceist tèarainteachd (1 à 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion6:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè an t-ainm a bha air a’ chiad sgoil dhan deach thu?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion5:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè an t-ainm a tha air a’ cho-ogha as sine agad?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion4:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè an t-ainm a tha air a’ bhaile anns an do choinnich do phàrantan?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè am far-ainm a bha ort nuair a bha thu òg?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè an t-ainm a tha air a’ bhaile anns an do rugadh tu?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dè an t-ainm a bha air a’ chiad pheata agad?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityAnswerPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Do fhreagairt
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ok, now type a password for your account.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruthaich facal-faire a ghabhas cur nad chuimhne glè mhath
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordReqErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Looks like you didn't meet all the password requirements. Let's try this again.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPolicy_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan eil am facal-faire a chuir thu a-steach cho toinnte ’s a bu chòir a-rèir nan riatanasan a shuidhich rianaire an lìonraidh no a’ bhuidhinn agad. Faighnich dhen rianaire dè na riatanasan agus cuir a-steach facal-faire ùr d’ a leithid an uairsin.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Facal-faire
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dèan cinnteach gun tagh thu rudeigin nach dìochuimhnich thu ri do bheò.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLabelText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach facal-faire
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Invalid_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan fhaod am facal-faire agad a bhith san leth-fhacal.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Empty_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum air leth-fhacal Dèan cinnteach gun toir e oidheam dhut mun fhacal-faire.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Great. Now. With an offline account, if you forget your password, the only way to retrieve it is with a hint, so make sure it's memorable.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir ris leth-fhacal airson an fhacail-fhaire agad
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leth-fhacal an fhacail-fhaire
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintLeadText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air eagal nach bi cuimhne agad air. Dèan cinnteach gun cruthaich thu fear nach dìochuimhnich thu idir.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: It's important that your password hint doesn't contain your password. That kind of defeats the purpose, really. Go ahead and pick another hint.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordEmpty_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach facal-faire.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirm_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan eil an dà fhacal-faire co-ionnann. Feuch is cuir a-steach a-rithist e.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: And one more time to make sure we've got it right…
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dearbh am facal-faire agad
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dearbh am facal-faire
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmLeadText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad aon turas eile.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmLabelText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dearbhadh an fhacail-fhaire
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Those passwords didn't match. Let's try this again. Type your password.
  \oobeLocalAccount\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeLocalAccount\LocalUser_NoUsername_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach an t-ainm-cleachdaiche agad.
  \oobeLocalAccount\Error_Creating_Account_Warning:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chaidh rudeigin cearr.
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A bheil an cunntas seo airson duine-cloinne no deugaire?
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mas ann mar seo a tha cùisean, saoil am b’ fheàirrde dhut clàradh a-steach air cunntas Microsoft? Ma chlàraicheas an fheadhainn òga do theaghlaich a-steach le cunntas Microsoft, bidh dìon prìobhaideachd aca a-rèir an aoise. ’S urrainn do phàrantan is luchd-glèidhidh buidheann teaghlaich a shuidheachadh le Microsoft Family Safety cuideachd.
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationOffline:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Airson barrachd fiosrachaidh, cleachd uidheam eile is tadhail air aka.ms/accounttype.
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadas leis a’ cheangal againn – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil rudeigin ceàrr a-bhos an-seo. Gheibh thu barrachd fiosrachaidh air clàradh a-steach le cunntas Microsoft le bhith a’ cur aka.ms/accounttype ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh ann am brabhsair sam bith air uidheam sam bith.
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationLearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu chlàradh a-steach le cunntas Microsoft
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \oobeLocalAccount\AgeConfirmationContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
