    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Use facial recognition
  \oobeHello\HelloMultiFace2SpeechConstraint:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Face recognition
  \oobeHello\HelloMultiFace1SpeechConstraint:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Face
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas gu bheil duilgheadasan againn leis a chomas-cheangail – dh’fhaoidte nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad no gu bheil duilgheadas againn a-bhos an-seo. ’S urrainn dhut aithris prìobhaideachd Microsoft a leughadh gu slàn uair sam bith ’s tu a’ sgrìobhadh aka.ms/privacy ann am bàr an t-seòlaidh aig brabhsair sam bith air uidheam sam bith.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu dhìon chunntasan
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha mothaichear airson lorg-meòir aig an uidheam agad a dh’obraicheas le Windows Hello agus leis a sin, tha dòigh shimplidh ri do làimh airson dearbhadh cò thusa gun fheum air facal-faire.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Obraichidh an camara agad le Windows Hello gus d’ aithneachadh agus bheir seo dòigh shimplidh ’s gun fhacal-faire dhut gus dearbhadh gur e tusa a th’ ann.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ìomhaigheag lorg-mheòir Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ìomhaigheag aodann Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Beòthachadh aodann Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air adhart
  \oobeHello\HelloButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha, suidhich e
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan eil, atharraich mar a chlàraicheas mi a-steach
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A-null leam gun àite far an urrainn dhomh roghainnean airson clàradh a-steach a thoirt air falbh agus an dàta agam a sguabadh às.
  \oobeHello\BioConsentTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir romhad a bheil thu airson clàradh a-steach le d’ aodann no lorg do mheòir fhathast
  \oobeHello\BioConsentSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A bheil thu airson dàta d’ aodainn no lorg do mheòir a ghlèidheadh air a’ PC seo fhathast?
  \oobeHello\BioConsentListAccessibleName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Glèidh na roghainnean agad airson clàradh a-steach
  \oobeHello\AllSetText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sin thu ullamh ma-thà!
  \oobeEula\YesButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabh ris
  \oobeEula\PageVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: An ath-rud, an stuth laghail. Ann am facal, feumaidh tu "Gabh ris" a thaghadh mus urrainn dhut Windows a chleachdadh. (’S urrainn dhut a dhiùltadh ach, tha fhios, cha bhi Windows agad an uairsin.)
  \oobeEula\OEMIFrameLabel:
