  \oobeCortana\cortanaSubHeading_newUwp:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ach feumaidh Cortana cothrom air cuid dhen fhiosrachadh phearsanta agad mus tèid aice sin a dhèanamh
  \oobeCortana\cortanaSubHeading_A:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha a h-uile duine airidh air cuidiche pearsanta. Mar a thachras, tha Cortana na cuidiche digiteach.
  \oobeCortana\cortanaSubHeadingVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Seall sin, siud mise, Cortana! A bheil cead agam am fiosrachadh a chleachdadh air a bheil feum agam airson ’s gun obraich mi cho math ’s a ghabhas?
  \oobeCortana\cortanaSubHeading:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Seall sin, siud mise, Cortana! <br/>A bheil cead agam am fiosrachadh a chleachdadh air a bheil feum agam airson ’s gun obraich mi cho math ’s a ghabhas?
  \oobeCortana\cortanaLogoAlt_globalConsent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuidichidh Cortana thu le bhith a’ cumail rian air an àm, a’ coileanadh rudan is a’ cumail an co-luadar. Cleachd Cortana airson sùil a thoirt air a’ mhìosachan agad, cuimhneachain a shuidheachadh, ceòl a chluich agus freagairtean fhaighinn.
  \oobeCortana\cortanaLogoAlt:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: suaicheantas Chortana
  \oobeCortana\cortanaHeading_newUwp:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le Cortana do chuideachadh le bhith a’ coileanadh rudan
  \oobeCortana\cortanaHeading_globalConsent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faigh cobhair on chuidiche digiteach agad
  \oobeCortana\cortanaHeading_A:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le Cortana do chuideachadh
  \oobeCortana\cortanaHeading:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A bheil thu airson Cortana a chleachdadh mar an cuidiche pearsanta agad?
  \oobeCortana\cortanaCaptionText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuidichidh Cortana thu le bhith a’ cumail rian air an àm, a’ coileanadh rudan is a’ cumail an co-luadar
