    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan fhaod am facal-faire agad a bhith san leth-fhacal.
  \localAccount\PasswordHint_Empty_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum air leth-fhacal. Dèan cinnteach gun toir e oidheam dhut mun fhacal-faire.
  \localAccount\PasswordConfirm_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan eil an dà fhacal-faire co-ionnann
  \localAccount\NextButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air a&dhart
  \localAccount\LocalUser_NoUsername_Error:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach an t-ainm-cleachdaiche agad.
  \localAccount\LeadText1:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma tha an cunntas seo airson duine-cloinne no deugaire, saoil an tagh thu <b>Air ais</b> ’s an cruthaich thu cunntas Microsoft? Ma chlàraicheas an fheadhainn òga do theaghlaich a-steach le cunntas Microsoft, bidh dìon prìobhaideachd aca a-rèir an aoise.
  \localAccount\LeadText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh facal-faire a bhios furasta dhutsa cuimhneachadh ach doirbh do dhaoine eile obrachadh a-mach.
  \localAccount\HintPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leth-fhacal an fhacail-fhaire
