  \errors\NoPinText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S urrainn dhut am PIN agad ath-shuidheachadh ann an “Roghainnean” » “Cunntasan” » “Roghainnean clàraidh a-steach”.
  \errors\NoNetworkVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: You will need the Internet for this. It does not look like you are connected to the Internet. Check your connection and try again.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh feum agad air an eadar-lìon airson seo.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha coltas nach eil ceangal ris an eadar-lìon agad an-dràsta. Thoir sùil air a’ cheangal is feuch ris a-rithist.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: We cannot open that page right now. For security reasons, you will need to visit the page from a browser or a different device.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan urrainn dhuinn an duilleag sin fhosgladh an-dràsta.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air sgàth adhbharan tèarainteachd, feumaidh tu tadhal air an duilleag o bhrabhsair no uidheam eile. Ma tha thu dhen bheachd gun do ràinig thu an duilleag seo ri linn mearachd, innis dhan sgioba taice ICT nach urrainn dhut {0} inntrigeadh
  \errors\LocalAccount:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leum seachad air
  \errors\GenericVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Something went wrong. Please try again later.
  \errors\GenericMsaText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Nach fheuch thu ris a-rithist an ceann greis?
  \errors\Cancel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sguir dheth
  \errors\BlockedByPolicyMSATitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan urrainn dhuinn do chlàradh a-steach le cunntas Microsoft
  \errors\AccountText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan urrainn dhuinn do chlàradh a-steach an-dràsta fhèin. Feuch ris a-rithist no tagh “Leum seachad air” gus clàradh a-steach às a dhèidh seo.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\TryAgainButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Feuch ris a-rithist
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\TitleSuccess:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Deiseil uile gu lèir!
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\TitleError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chaidh rudeigin cearr
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\TitleCancel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Fuirich ort, tha seo cudromach
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Title:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Feumaidh am buidheann agad Windows Hello
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Timestamp:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Stampa-tìde:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\SpecialErrorInfo:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Airson barrachd fiosrachaidh mu mhearachdan a nochdas rè suidheachadh PIN: https://aka.ms/PINErrors
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\SetUpPinButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Suidhich PIN
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\PadlockTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Glas-chrochaidh
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\OkButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceart ma-thà
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpLink:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ciamar as urrainn dha PIN a bhith nas tèarainte na facal-faire fada?
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpHeadline:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Oir chan obraich am PIN agad ach leis an uidheam seo
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpBody:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh daoine a’ cleachdadh an aon fhacal-faire airson diofar rudan uaireannan ach ’s e PIN a tha àraidh dhan uidheam seo a tha sa PIN seo. Chan eil am PIN gu feum sam bith dha hacker fad air falbh.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\ErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir fios gun sgioba-taice agad is thoir dhaibh am fiosrachadh a leanas airson barrachd cuideachaidh.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\ErrorCode:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Còd na mearachd:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\CorrelationId:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ID na co-dhàimh:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\CancelButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gearr leum thairis air an-dràsta
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyTpmError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan eil an Trusted Platform Module, a chleachdar gus am PIN agad a dhìon air an uidheam seo, ri fhaighinn aig an àm seo. Obraichidh e aig amannan ma dh’fheuchas tu a-rithist e, air neo ’s urrainn dhut leum a ghearradh seachad air an-dràsta is seo a dhèanamh uaireigin eile.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodySuccess:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S urrainn dhut clàradh a-steach leis a’ PIN ùr agad an-dràsta.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyServerError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chan urrainn dhuinn ceangal ris an fhrithealaiche mar bu chòir gus am PIN agad a shuidheachadh an-dràsta fhèin. Feuch ris a-rithist e air neo ’s urrainn dhut leum a ghearradh seachad air an-dràsta is seo a dhèanamh uaireigin eile.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyHelloCancel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Feumaidh tu PIN a shuidheachadh gus Windows Hello a chleachdadh. Cha toir seo ach greiseag.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyHello:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Suidhich PIN as urrainn dhut cleachdadh an àite Windows Hello. Dh’fhaoidte nach bi feum agad air idir, ach bidh e na lethbhreac-glèidhidh dhut co-dhiù.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyError:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am PIN agad a shuidheachadh. Obraichidh e aig amannan ma dh’fheuchas tu a-rithist e, air neo ’s urrainn dhut leum a ghearradh seachad air an-dràsta is seo a dhèanamh uaireigin eile.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyCancel:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Feumaidh tu PIN a shuidheachadh gus an t-uidheam seo a chleachdadh.  Cha toir seo ach greiseag.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Body:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha e furasta facal-faire a ghoid. Le Windows Hello, gheibh thu dà rud còmhla – an t-uidheam agad agus beò-meatrachd no PIN – seach facal-faire gus do chlàradh a-steach air an uidheam agad no dha na h-aplacaidean is seirbheisean agad.
  \deviceUser\UserPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Post-d
  \deviceUser\Title:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir cunntas uidheim ris
  \deviceUser\PasswordPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Facal-faire
  \deviceUser\NextButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air a&dhart
  \deviceUser\LeadText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A bheil an t-uidheam seo ann an rum-obrach co-roinnte? Ma tha, cuir a-steach an cunntas a bheir cothrom air aplacaidean mar Microsoft Teams agus Skype do chleachdaiche sam bith.
  \deviceUser\Error_UsernameFormat:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach post-d agad mar cuideigin@example.com
  \deviceUser\Error_PasswordExpired:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dh’fhalbh an ùine air an fhacal-faire aig a’ chunntas seo.
  \deviceUser\Error_NoUsername:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach am post-d agad.
  \deviceUser\Error_LogonFailure:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha am post-d no facal-faire cearr.
  \deviceUser\ErrorDialog:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thachair mearachd:	0x
  \deviceUser\BackButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: &Air ais
  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ann am facal, ’s mise do chuidiche pearsanta.<br/>Deiseil is deònach.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Shin thu, ’s mise Cortana.<br/>Nì mise rudan nas fhasa dhut agus cuidichidh mi thu a’ dèanamh rudan.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S i Cortana do cho-làmhaiche a bhios deiseil is deònach do chuideachadh uair sam bith.<br/><br/>Airson ’s gun urrainn dha Cortana dreach pearsantaichte a chur air rudan dhut is molaidhean iomchaidh a thoirt dhut, cruinnichidh is cleachdaidh Microsoft dàta mar d’ ionad is eachdraidh nan ionad, luchd-aithne, ion-chur gutha, pàtranan gutha ’s làmh-sgrìobhaidh, na sgrìobh is na lorg thu roimhe, fiosrachadh mun mhìosachan, susbaint is eachdraidh conaltraidh o theachdaireachdan is aplacaidean is fiosrachadh eile on uidheam agad. Ann am Microsoft Edge, cleachdaidh Cortana an eachdraidh brabhsaidh agad. ’S urrainn dhut na chuimhnicheas Cortana a chur air gleus san leabhar-nòtaichean agus a chur à comas ann am Microsoft Edge.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Air sgàth adhbharan tèarainteachd, cuir a-steach am facal-faire agad aon turas eile.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: 2532485720
